0..45 Comment "// A cut commits a choice to its left branch."
46..48 Comment "//"
49..127 Comment "// The command sort carries an end grade. `bot` marks a computation that cuts."
128..168 Comment "// `top` marks a computation that fails."
169..171 Comment "//"
172..220 Comment "// The command face reads the law on operations."
221..299 Comment "// A nested call reads the law on terms. Each operation carries the grade that"
300..374 Comment "// its sort fixes. A call with incompatible argument grades is ill sorted."
375..377 Comment "//"
378..392 Comment "// - see: #640"
